{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model with multiprofile setting and avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5907 and F1 of 0.5727. These results suggest multiprofile may offer some performance benefit compared to singleprofile RNA-only baselines, but the effect remains uncertain due to lack of direct comparison with multimodal multiprofile configurations. The role of avgpool aggregation versus other methods and its interaction with profile settings require further investigation."
}

